%% HotelSync - reservation and payment phase (2026-10-30)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor G as Huésped
  participant BFF as Front BFF
  participant BK as booking
  participant RA as rate-availability
  participant PAY as payment
  participant MQ as hotelsync.events

  G->>BFF: POST /api/booking/v1/bookings
  BFF->>BK: POST /v1/bookings (JWT)
  BK->>BK: crea reserva pending y outbox booking.created
  BK-->>G: booking pending + manage token
  G->>BFF: POST /api/payments/v1/checkout
  BFF->>PAY: POST /v1/checkout
  PAY->>PAY: registra PaymentTransaction y simula gateway
  PAY->>MQ: payment.completed (outbox)
  MQ->>BK: payment.completed
  BK->>RA: POST /v1/availability/reserve (idempotency key)
  RA-->>BK: inventario comprometido
  BK->>BK: status confirmed, payment PAID, version++
  BK->>MQ: booking.confirmed + booking.paid
  Note over G,BK: La reserva queda confirmada. Los consumidores reaccionan en el panel b.
